{#
  /menu/. Brief: SITE_ARCHITECTURE.md.
  P0, and the highest-confidence page on the project: 573 menu queries earning
  6,160 clicks with no menu page to land on. Target `tajima menu` (2,814
  clicks, 66.1% CTR).

  NOT LAUNCH-READY, AND THE REASON IS DATA, NOT BUILD. SITE_ARCHITECTURE.md
  Open Decision #12: we do not have the per-location menus. This page renders
  the ten dishes confirmed in CLIENT_FACTS.md at brand-level prices. It is not
  the real menu until the Toast pull happens.

  Two brief sections could not be built and are absent rather than faked:

    THE LOCATION SWITCHER (brief section 1) needs the `locations` availability
    column, which is empty on every row in menu.json. A switcher that filters
    nothing, or that claims a dish is sold somewhere we have not verified, is
    worse than no switcher. Three menus genuinely differ (College Heights runs
    a pared-down ramen bar, Plaza Bonita is quick-serve with no alcohol, Maui
    has its own dishes), so this is the whole point of the section.

    RICE DISHES AND DRINKS (brief sections 5 and 7) have no confirmed items in
    CLIENT_FACTS.md. Sections render from data, so they simply do not appear.

  Carnitas Ramen is absent pending Open Decision #4. The recommendation on
  record is to list it plainly with feature: no. It is a data change, not a
  template change: add the row and it renders as a quiet line.
#}

{%- set ramen = menu.items | selectattr("section", "equalto", "ramen") | list %}
{%- set izakaya = menu.items | selectattr("section", "equalto", "izakaya") | list %}
{%- set dessert = menu.items | selectattr("section", "equalto", "dessert") | list %}

{# ============================ MENU HERO ============================ #}
{#
  REWRITTEN. The concept sub read: "Every noodle, cut daily. Every broth,
  simmered for twelve. Built in Convoy, since 2001."
  The first two are the same unconfirmed claims that run through every concept
  file: noodle cadence is not confirmed, and no simmer time is confirmed
  anywhere. The third is true and is kept.
#}
<section class="menu-hero" aria-labelledby="page-title">
  <div class="menu-hero__inner">

    <div class="menu-hero__lead">
      <span class="menu-hero__eyebrow">The Menu</span>
      <h1 class="menu-hero__title" id="page-title">
        {{ ramen | length }} bowls.<br><em>One room.</em>
      </h1>
      <p class="menu-hero__sub">
        Broth simmered every morning in Crown Point. Noodles from <a href="/noodle-room/">our own Noodle Room</a>. Built in Convoy, since 2001.
      </p>
    </div>

    <nav class="menu-hero__jumps" aria-label="Jump to section">
      <a class="menu-hero__jump" href="#ramen">
        <span class="menu-hero__jump-num">01</span>
        <span class="menu-hero__jump-name">Ramen</span>
        <span class="menu-hero__jump-count">{{ ramen | length }} bowls</span>
      </a>
      <a class="menu-hero__jump" href="#izakaya">
        <span class="menu-hero__jump-num">02</span>
        <span class="menu-hero__jump-name">Izakaya</span>
        <span class="menu-hero__jump-count">Small plates</span>
      </a>
      <a class="menu-hero__jump" href="#dessert">
        <span class="menu-hero__jump-num">03</span>
        <span class="menu-hero__jump-name">Dessert</span>
        <span class="menu-hero__jump-count">Matcha</span>
      </a>
      <a class="menu-hero__jump" href="/order-online/">
        <span class="menu-hero__jump-num">04</span>
        <span class="menu-hero__jump-name">Order</span>
        <span class="menu-hero__jump-count">Online</span>
      </a>
    </nav>

  </div>
</section>

{# ============================ RAMEN ============================ #}
<section class="menu-section" id="ramen" aria-labelledby="ramen-title">
  <div class="menu-section__inner">

    <header class="menu-section__head reveal reveal--d1">
      <span class="menu-section__eyebrow">01 &middot; Ramen</span>
      <h2 class="menu-section__title" id="ramen-title">
        {{ ramen | length }} bowls. <em>The trio</em> is the house.
      </h2>
      {#
        Brief section 2: one line above the ramen section saying the noodles
        are made in our own room, linking to /noodle-room/. "This is the only
        selling on the page." Everything below it is ingredients.
      #}
      <p class="menu-section__note">
        The Tajima Red, Black, and White are the same broth with three finishes. The noodles are made in <a href="/noodle-room/">our own Noodle Room</a> in Crown Point.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="bento bento--ramen">
      {%- for dish in ramen %}
      <article class="dish {% if dish.feature %}dish--feature{% else %}dish--quiet{% endif %}{% if dish.bento %} dish--{{ dish.bento }}{% endif %} reveal reveal--d{{ loop.index % 4 + 1 }}">
        {%- if dish.image %}
        <div class="dish__photo">
          <img src="{{ dish.image }}" alt="{{ dish.alt }}" loading="lazy" width="800" height="800">
        </div>
        {%- endif %}
        <div class="dish__body">
          <div class="dish__head">
            {%- if dish.tier %}
            <span class="dish__tier{% if dish.tier == 'Signature trio' %} dish__tier--signature{% endif %}">{{ dish.tier }}</span>
            {%- endif %}
            <span class="dish__price">${{ dish.price }}</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="dish__name">
            {%- if dish.emphasis -%}
              {{ dish.name | replace(dish.emphasis, "") | replace("Ramen", "") | trim }} <em>{{ dish.emphasis }}</em>
            {%- else -%}
              {{ dish.name }}
            {%- endif -%}
          </h3>
          {%- if dish.romaji %}
          <p class="dish__romaji">{{ dish.romaji }}</p>
          {%- endif %}
          {#
            Descriptions come from menu.json only. Items with no confirmed
            ingredient list render without one rather than getting a written
            description. CLAUDE.md: menu descriptions are never generated.
          #}
          {%- if dish.description %}
          <p class="dish__desc">{{ dish.description }}</p>
          {%- endif %}
          {%- if "vegan" in dish.dietary %}
          <p class="dish__desc"><a href="/menu/vegan-ramen/">More about the vegan bowl</a></p>
          {%- endif %}
        </div>
      </article>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

{# ============================ IZAKAYA ============================ #}
<section class="menu-section menu-section--alt" id="izakaya" aria-labelledby="izakaya-title">
  <div class="menu-section__inner">

    <header class="menu-section__head reveal reveal--d1">
      <span class="menu-section__eyebrow">02 &middot; Izakaya</span>
      <h2 class="menu-section__title" id="izakaya-title">Small <em>plates.</em></h2>
      <p class="menu-section__note">
        Izakaya plates run alongside the bowls. What is on offer varies by room.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="bento bento--izakaya">
      {%- for dish in izakaya %}
      <article class="dish dish--quiet reveal reveal--d{{ loop.index % 4 + 1 }}">
        <div class="dish__body">
          <div class="dish__head">
            <span class="dish__price">${{ dish.price }}</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="dish__name">{{ dish.name }}</h3>
          {%- if dish.description %}
          <p class="dish__desc">{{ dish.description }}</p>
          {%- endif %}
        </div>
      </article>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

