{#
  Dietary note. CLIENT_FACTS.md: no gluten-free noodle option exists, some
  dishes may be prepared GF, and the honest line is to ask staff. Do not imply
  a GF noodle.
#}
<section class="menu-end" aria-labelledby="menu-end-title">
  <div class="menu-end__inner">

    <div class="menu-end__lead">
      <span class="menu-end__eyebrow">Menus vary by room</span>
      <h2 class="menu-end__title" id="menu-end-title">
        Find the room <em>closest to you.</em>
      </h2>
      <p class="menu-end__sub">
        Walk in at every location. Mercury takes reservations by phone, for groups only.
      </p>
      <div class="menu-end__actions">
        <a class="menu-end__cta menu-end__cta--primary" href="/locations/">
          See the locations
          <span aria-hidden="true">&#8594;</span>
        </a>
        <a class="menu-end__cta menu-end__cta--quiet" href="/order-online/">
          Order online
          <span aria-hidden="true">&#8594;</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    {#
      Dietary key. Two changes from the concept:
        - Its GF line used an em dash ("prepared GF — ask the floor"). Hard rule.
        - It listed Tajima Fries as vegan as plated. Tajima Fries is on the
          CLIENT_FACTS.md do-not-feature list and is not in menu.json, so it is
          not named here.
      The GF wording stays honest: no GF noodle exists and we do not imply one.
    #}
    <aside class="menu-end__legend" aria-label="A note on the menu">
      <h3 class="menu-end__legend-title">A note on the menu</h3>
      <dl class="menu-end__legend-list">
        <dt>Vegan</dt>
        <dd>The Vegan Ramen is the only fully vegan bowl. It is built on our own spinach noodles. Edamame is vegan as plated.</dd>
        <dt>Gluten</dt>
        <dd>There is no gluten-free noodle. Some dishes can be prepared without gluten, so ask the crew.</dd>
        <dt>Allergens</dt>
        <dd>Soy, wheat, shellfish, egg, and dairy are present across the menu. Ask and the crew will tell you.</dd>
        <dt>Sushi</dt>
        <dd>Mercury and Maui only.</dd>
      </dl>
    </aside>

  </div>
</section>
